Project Development Phase
EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

Project Development Phase

1. Introduction

The Development Phase is the stage where the proposed EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant is converted from a design into a working application. In this phase, the frontend, backend, database, and Gemini AI integration are developed and connected.

EduGenie is designed to help students understand lessons, ask questions, generate summaries, create study materials, and receive personalized learning assistance using Google Gemini AI.


---

2. Objectives of Development

The main objectives are:

To develop a simple and user-friendly learning interface.

To integrate Google Gemini AI for intelligent responses.

To allow students to ask academic questions.

To generate summaries and explanations.

To provide personalized learning assistance.

To store relevant student and learning information.

To test the application for accuracy and usability.



---

