6. Main Features Developed

1. AI Chat Assistant

Students can ask questions and receive AI-generated explanations.

2. Topic Explanation

EduGenie can explain difficult topics in simple language.

3. Summarization

Long study material can be converted into short and understandable notes.

4. Quiz Generation

The system can generate questions based on a selected topic.

5. Study Assistance

Students can use the assistant for revision, examples, and concept clarification.

6. Chat History

